---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageName="About">
  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>Hey, I'm Sandy. Welcome to my little corner on the web.</p>
  <p>
    I'm currently based in the Frankfurt metropolitan area, though I've called a
    number of places &quot;home&quot; during my 30-something years in this
    world, including Taipei, Vancouver, Montreal, Dubai, and Budapest.
  </p>
  <p>
    The job titles I've held in recent years have been along some variation of
    Frontend/Software&nbsp;Engineer/Developer, though to be honest, I don't put
    much stock into job titles. In my own words: I write software for human
    beings and naturally gravitate towards solving problems that impact user
    experience. Most of the time this falls in the frontend realm, but really,
    who's drawing lines?
  </p>
  <p>
    I like rainy days, speculative fiction, and exploring the intersection of
    coding and creativity. I am a serial DIY-er with a bad case of "I'll bet I
    can make that myself" syndrome. I love <a
      href="https://personalsit.es/with-feed/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer">websites with RSS feeds</a
    > and the <a href="https://indieweb.org/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer"
      >IndieWeb</a
    >. I have a tendency towards run-on sentences and I'm a firm believer in the
    Oxford comma.
  </p>
  <p>
    You can find me on <a
      href="
      https:
      github.com
      kuosandys"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noreferrer">GitHub</a
    > or on a hiking trail somewhere in the mountains.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
